 sequenceDiagram
      autonumber
      participant W as Inbound worker
      participant A as Agent
      participant DB as SQLite
      participant L as llama-server (chat)
      participant E as llama-server (embed)
      participant T as Telegram

      W->>DB: claim_oldest_inbound (lease)
      W->>A: handle_inbound_claim
      A->>DB: assert claim, start/resume trace, save user turn
      A->>L: (internal) plan_recall, select_task_context, rerank_recall
      A->>E: embed recall query
      A->>DB: hybrid search chunks + memories, task context
      loop each round until plain text
          A->>A: assert inbound claim still held
          A->>L: generate(messages, tools, tool_choice=auto)
          L-->>A: response (stored per round for replay)
          alt has tool_calls
              A->>A: guards: no repeated identical call,<br/>cumulative call/byte limits
              A->>DB: save assistant tool-call turn
              A->>DB: execute tool + tool-result transcript (atomic)
              A->>A: append bounded tool result to messages
          else final content
              A->>A: trim, qualify Task/Reminder/Memory IDs,<br/>commitment guard (no unbacked "I'll remind you")
              A->>DB: record_response_output
          end
      end
      A->>E: embed completed exchange chunks
      A->>DB: prepare_delivery, mark attempting
      A->>T: sendMessage(text, bold entities)
      alt sent
          T-->>A: message_id
          A->>DB: complete_inbound_delivery_indexed (atomic)
      else failed
          A->>DB: fail_delivery, so the claim stays retryable
      end
